{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Esau's World is a game of Saving a Brother. Play as Jake, barging into the magical world of his brother Esau, daring to rekindle their broken relationship. As he begins to bind the old scars ripped open, festering soul-cancer is opened underneath.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Experience the first connection by playing the demo!</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Walk alongside</strong> your brother through team-based puzzles in single-player mode! Plan out what Esau will do ahead of time and then act in tandem to overcome any challenge!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Complete</strong> optional challenges and special puzzle rooms hidden under every bush!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Escape</strong> the demons writhing in the shadows of Esau's soul</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>You only have one chance to save him.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902490/extras/Gif1.gif?t=1740195163\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902490/extras/Gif2b.gif?t=1740195163\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2902490?t=1740195163","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2902490?t=1740195163","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902490/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740195163","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902490/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740195163","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_desc